    "text": "hudsonvalleypress.com\nwebsite\nOrange County, New York\nSkoufis Announces Major Funding For SUNY Orange\n1 days ago\nSenator James Skoufis (D-Orange County) joined SUNY Orange President Dr. Kristine Young to announce $250,000 in new state funding for the community college. The funding will help establish SUNY Orange’s AI & Healthcare Workforce Center, the first initiative of its kind in the state. SUNY Orange has long been...\n4",
